# 2026-08-09 — ONE LIBRARY. schooltrusts.org and schooltrusts.net were two
# websites both presenting themselves as America's School Trust Library, with
# different navigation and different names for the same shelves. They are now
# one site, served at schooltrusts.org, built from this repository.
#
# These rules retire the paths that were unique to the old schooltrusts.org
# worker. Every one of them was a live, linkable URL; none may 404.
