# (ISBN 979-8-1819289-2-3) resolve to schooltrusts.net/reading/us-XX/. Those
# paths are unchanged in this build, and the schooltrusts.net domain must
# redirect to schooltrusts.org preserving the path, forever. The .net
# registration must never be allowed to lapse.
